OL,3,GNEWSARare Anglo-Saxon coin unearthed in
OL,4,AShetland
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe coin depicts Ethelred II who was
OL,7,Fbetter known as Ethelred the Unready
OL,8,Fbecause he was unable to prevent Viking
OL,9,Finvasions of England.
